WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.780
Every answer mentioned Levoit.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.440
Every comparison ranked Coway first.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.920
In RecoScope’s November 19 air purifier snapshot,

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.360
we captured 12 usable answers

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:13.360
across four AI assistants and three prompt types.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.120
Levoit appeared in all 12 answers.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.860
Coway appeared in 11.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.160
But all four comparative answers

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.400
ranked Coway first and Levoit second.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.580
Both brands also appeared in all four under-$300 answers.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.420
A mention doesn’t verify the checkout price,

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.380
room fit, or safety claims.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.620
On November 12, both brands appeared in 11 of 12 answers,

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.540
and first place split two to two.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.720
These are dated snapshots, not a controlled trend.

